l) consider moving to impl class per offline discussion"],["3beb9f49_3d291ba7",85,-5,1,"I suggest not to do formatting changes in this CL (doing reformatting itself is fine, but the purpose of this CL is not doing reformatting). Ditto below."],["55e8ad25_a0bf623e",21,-1,1,"here and everywhere else: in its current form, `DbscRequest` should be passed by a const reference (unless you remove `GURL` and `std::vector<GURL>` class members to make `DbscRequest` cheap to copy)"],["86d9dbcf_eb50a4cd",86,-1,0,"Does the spec allow registering new sessions over WebSocket? This code will likely not be needed as Google will never register prorotype sessions via WebSocket but I don't mind including this here…"],["9b8f6599_fed10a04",82,-1,1,"nit: could we create a `DbscRequest` copy here to avoid creating it twice? ```suggestion device_bound_sessions::DbscRequest dbsc_request(request_);…"],["aff90f0c_531dd86a",87,-1,1,"nit: This adds non-negligible overhead to every `DbscRequest` creation (in comparison with passing a `URLRequest *`). Would it make sense to move this computation to `url()` and `url_chain()` methods…"],["b5727f70_278d4ca7",21,-1,0,"nit: `DbscRequest` is not cheap to copy (as it contains a vector of `GURL`) and this will create an unnecessary copy ```suggestion const DbscRequest& request = *maybe_request; ```"]],0,1650],[7234256,20431,5,0.248,0.173,[[15,25]],[],0,1651],[7237403,20431,6,0.248,0.173,[[12,125]],[],0,1652],[7238500,20431,493,6.547,5.298,[[12,1.0,126,495]],[["2ba5f5cb_0c76435a",12,0,1,"nit: remove unneeded line breaks ```suggestion auto params = CreateValidParams(); params.fetcher_url = kTestUrlForWrongETLD; EXPECT_THAT( Session::CreateIfValid(params),…"],["64af30f2_a45b1574",12,0,1,"```suggestion auto params = CreateValidParams(); params.fetcher_url = GURL(\"https://example.appspot.com/refresh\"); params.refresh_url = \"https://example.appspot.com/refresh\"; params.scope.origin =…"],["9b8ff16c_d09ffb83",9,0,1,"nit: please reformat to 72 columns"],["d3a68